# EchoLearn — Environment Variables Template
# Copy this to .env.local and fill in your values. NEVER commit .env.local.

# ── Client-side (Vite exposes VITE_* to the browser) ──────────
# Firebase web config is set in src/lib/firebase.ts. Local tests use synthetic sessions or the emulator.

# (Optional) Custom YouTube CORS proxy base URL
VITE_YOUTUBE_PROXY=/api/yt?url=

# ── Server-side only (Vercel env vars, NOT prefixed with VITE_) ──
# These are set in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-xxx          (used by api/ai.ts)
# AI_PROVIDER=deepseek              (switch to gemini to use Gemini)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key    (server-side only; never use VITE_ prefix)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite (optional override)
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIza-xxx         (used by api/youtube.ts)
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id  (optional server-side auth verifier override; match src/lib/firebase.ts)
# YTDLP_API_KEY=xxxxxxxx            (server-side only; used by api/transcript.ts and api/bilibili.ts to authenticate to the VPS)
#
# MW_LEARNERS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
#   Merriam-Webster Learner's Dictionary key (api/dictionary.ts, Tier 1).
#   Free at https://dictionaryapi.com — 1000 requests/day, non-commercial.
#   Without it the dictionary silently degrades to Free Dictionary / Datamuse,
#   which means learner-grade sense ordering and UK IPA are lost.
